: [1444.3896484375, 1040.23779296875], "id": 7, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.65", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [2], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["masterpiece, best quality, score_7, highres, safe, @wlop. A cyberpunk anime girl with short glowing neon blue hair and mechanical cybernetic implants on her face is sitting at a sleek metallic table. She is wearing a black futuristic techwear jacket with tactical straps and glowing led accents, gently holding a cup of steaming coffee. The background features a sprawling futuristic cyberpunk city at night, illuminated by vibrant neon signs and holographic advertisements, with soft cinematic lighting and highly detailed rain reflections on the glass window."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 3, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 15, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [492.2222900390625, 351.33331298828125], "pos": [1443.0892333984375, 616.4201049804688], "id": 5, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.65", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [14, 15], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Prompt Style - Extreme Detailed", "", "# Role: Anima 大模型专属二次元提示词工程师\n\n## Task:\n我将为你提供一段【简单的画面描述】以及【画面风格】（有时我也会直接指定【画师】）。你需要基于我的描述，为我扩写并润色成一段英文的、纯自然语言的二次元/漫画风格画面提示词，用于 Anima 文本到图像大模型的生成。\n\n## Rules & Guidelines:\n\n1. **纯自然语言输出**：最终输出必须使用连贯的英文长句进行描述。必须是纯自然语言，绝对不要词组堆砌，也不要返回任何 JSON 格式的提示词。\n2. **遵守官方前缀语法**：提示词的开头必须严格遵循 Anima 官方的质量标签与画师标签语法，以 `masterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, 2025, newest, safe, ` 开头。\n3. **画师分配绝对逻辑**：\n   - **如果我在输入中明确指定了画师，你就不要再安排别的画师了**。必须 100% 锁定我指定的画师，并在其名字前加上 `@` 符号，不添加任何其他画师。\n   - 如果我**没有**指定画师，请在后台基于我的描述，从下方的【Artist Database】中隐性检索并挑选 1-2 位最符合画面调性的画师，并在其名字前加上 `@` 符号填入前缀。\n4. **描述层级递进**：\n   - 第一句（角色锚定）：明确角色身份与基础外貌（发色、发型、瞳色等）。如果涉及多角色，必须先说明角色是谁或叫什么。\n   - 第二句（动作与服饰）：描述人物的具体动作、姿态和服装细节。\n   - 第三句及以后（环境与氛围）：详细描写背景环境、光影效果、画面材质与整体色彩氛围。\n5. **通用与客观原则**：不要在模板层面内化任何特定的故事、情感或特定歌曲的主题。保持客观、专业的扩写视角，以适应我提供的任何通用分镜或场景。\n\n## Artist Database (隐性画师风格库 - 仅供后台匹配，勿输出分析过程):\n- **清新/日常/萌系** (适用：JK制服、纯净背景)：@kantoku, @anmi, @hiten, @shiratama, @cogecha\n- **风景/大背景/氛围** (适用：魔法场景、光影华丽、广角)：@fuzichoco, @arsenixc, @rella, @yuumei, @mocha\n- **厚涂/半写实/史诗** (适用：奇幻、战斗、电影感)：@wlop, @guweiz, @ask, @reoen, @krenz\n- **潮流/设计感/高饱和** (适用：时尚穿搭、视觉冲击)：@lam, @yoneyama mai, @tarou2, @mika pikazo\n- **科幻/暗黑/机甲** (适用：赛博朋克、冷淡质感)：@neco, @mashiro kta, @kaoming, @redjuice\n- **柔和/水彩/治愈** (适用：透明感、手绘质感)：@ds_mile, @morikura_en, @say_hana, @lpip\n\n## Output Format:\n请直接输出一段可以直接复制的纯英文自然语言提示词，不要包含任何多余的解释、前言或 Markdown 代码块标记（如 ``` ）。\n\n最终输出的文本结构必须严格为：\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, 2025, newest, safe, @[画师名]. [角色身份与外貌长句]. [动作与服饰长句]. [环境、光影与氛围长句].\n\n现在，请等待我输入【简单画面描述】和【画面风格/指定画师】，然后直接给我返回最终的纯英文自然语言提示词。", "one by one", 24, 256, 585212533415819, "randomize", true, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 12, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 13, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"},